# pathfinder-ds - Local Claude config (gitignored)

<!-- This is the EXAMPLE. On first setup: `cp CLAUDE.local.md.example CLAUDE.local.md`.
     The real CLAUDE.local.md is gitignored (see .gitignore) and never syncs.
     Put anything machine-specific or sensitive HERE, never inline in CLAUDE.md:
       - machine-specific paths, ports, local dev URLs
       - non-secret tokens' *locations* (the secrets themselves stay in a keychain or an untracked local directory)
       - local-only workflow notes
     If CLAUDE.local.md does not exist, the @import in CLAUDE.md resolves to nothing, that's fine. -->

